        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Accept quoted Ollama reset timestamps",
        "body": "## Summary\n- parse Ollama `data-time` reset attributes with single or double quotes\n- tolerate whitespace around the HTML attribute assignment\n- preserve the existing fractional and non-fractional ISO-8601 handling\n\n## Proof\nThe focused settings HTML fixture uses `data-time = '2026-01-30T18:00:00Z'` and proves it maps to the expected session reset date. All 10 focused parser tests pass.\n\nNo live account or browser-cookie probe was run: AGENTS.md requires parser fixtures for this behavior unless live provider access is explicitly requested, and this avoids any Keychain prompt.\n\n## Tests\n- `swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OllamaUsageParserTests` (10 passed)\n- changed Swift files: SwiftFormat and SwiftLint strict passed\n- `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD`\n\n## Commits\n- 3 focused commits: implementation, tests, documentation",
